# Copy to `.env` to choose which protocol a plain `docker compose up` serves. `.env` itself is
# git-ignored, so each checkout decides for itself.
#
#   sila2        the SiLA2 servers (what labcode's SiLA2 flavour drives)
#   lads         the LADS OPC UA servers
#   sila2,lads   both at once, over the one shared world model
#
# The laboratory model always starts. A COMPOSE_PROFILES set in the shell, or a --profile on
# the command line, takes precedence over this file.
COMPOSE_PROFILES=sila2
